**Ng\'e0y \uc0\u273 \u7847 u ti\'ean \u273 \u7871 n l\u7899 p**\
\
Xin ch\'e0o nh\uc0\u7853 t k\'fd!\
\
H\'f4m nay l\'e0 ng\'e0y \uc0\u273 \u7847 u ti\'ean m\'ecnh \u273 i h\u7885 c.\
\
M\'ecnh d\uc0\u7853 y t\u7915  r\u7845 t s\u7899 m. M\u7865  gi\'fap m\'ecnh ch\u7843 i b\u7897  l\'f4ng m\'e0u cam v\u7899 i nh\u7919 ng s\u7885 c \u273 en th\u7853 t g\u7885 n g\'e0ng.\
\
Th\'fa th\uc0\u7853 t nh\'e9...\
\
M\'ecnh h\uc0\u417 i lo.\
\
M\'ecnh l\'e0 m\uc0\u7897 t ch\'fa h\u7893  con, c\'f2n l\u7899 p h\u7885 c c\'f3 r\u7845 t nhi\u7873 u b\u7841 n kh\'e1c nh\u432  kh\u7881 , voi, h\u432 \u417 u cao c\u7893  v\'e0 ng\u7921 a v\u7857 n.\
\
Li\uc0\u7879 u m\'ecnh c\'f3 k\u7871 t b\u7841 n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c kh\'f4ng nh\u7881 ?\
\
Khi \uc0\u273 \u7871 n l\u7899 p, c\'f4 C\'fa th\'f4ng th\'e1i m\u7881 m c\u432 \u7901 i:\
\
\'97 Ch\'e0o m\uc0\u7915 ng c\'e1c em \u273 \u7871 n v\u7899 i l\u7899 p h\u7885 c R\u7915 ng Xanh!\
\
M\uc0\u7885 i ng\u432 \u7901 i ng\u7891 i th\'e0nh m\u7897 t v\'f2ng tr\'f2n.\
\
\uc0\u272 \u7871 n l\u432 \u7907 t gi\u7899 i thi\u7879 u b\u7843 n th\'e2n, m\'ecnh \u273 \u7913 ng d\u7853 y:\
\
\'97 M\'ecnh l\'e0 Tigo.\
\
\'97 M\'ecnh th\'edch ch\uc0\u7841 y th\u7853 t nhanh!\
\
C\'e1c b\uc0\u7841 n l\u7853 p t\u7913 c tr\'f2n m\u7855 t.\
\
\'97 Nhanh \uc0\u273 \u7871 n m\u7913 c n\'e0o v\u7853 y?\
\
M\'ecnh ng\uc0\u432 \u7907 ng ng\'f9ng \u273 \'e1p:\
\
\'97 H\uc0\u7893  c\'f3 th\u7875  ch\u7841 y r\u7845 t nhanh khi c\u7847 n \u273 \u7845 y!\
\
C\uc0\u7843  l\u7899 p v\u7895  tay th\'edch th\'fa.\
\
Gi\uc0\u7901  ra ch\u417 i c\'f2n vui h\u417 n n\u7919 a.\
\
Kiki, ch\'fa kh\uc0\u7881  tinh ngh\u7883 ch, r\u7911  m\'ecnh ch\u417 i \u273 u\u7893 i b\u7855 t.\
\
Ban \uc0\u273 \u7847 u m\'ecnh ngh\u297  ch\u7855 c m\'ecnh s\u7869  th\u7855 ng d\u7877  d\'e0ng.\
\
Nh\uc0\u432 ng Kiki leo c\'e2y nhanh qu\'e1!\
\
M\'ecnh \uc0\u273 u\u7893 i m\'e3i v\u7851 n kh\'f4ng b\u7855 t \u273 \u432 \u7907 c.\
\
C\uc0\u7843  hai c\u432 \u7901 i vang c\u7843  s\'e2n tr\u432 \u7901 ng.\
\
\uc0\u272 \u7871 n gi\u7901  h\u7885 c cu\u7889 i c\'f9ng, c\'f4 gi\'e1o mang \u273 \u7871 n m\u7897 t tr\'f2 ch\u417 i \u273 \u7863 c bi\u7879 t.\
\
C\'f4 gi\uc0\u7845 u v\'e0i m\'f3n \u273 \u7891  trong khu v\u432 \u7901 n nh\u7887  v\'e0 y\'eau c\u7847 u c\u7843  l\u7899 p t\'ecm ch\'fang.\
\
M\'ecnh nhanh ch\'f3ng ph\'e1t hi\uc0\u7879 n chi\u7871 c kh\u259 n \u273 \u7887  n\u7857 m sau b\u7909 i c\'e2y.\
\
\'97 L\'e0m sao em nh\'ecn th\uc0\u7845 y v\u7853 y? \'97 c\'f4 h\u7887 i.\
\
M\'ecnh vui v\uc0\u7867  tr\u7843  l\u7901 i:\
\
\'97 H\uc0\u7893  c\'f3 \u273 \'f4i m\u7855 t r\u7845 t tinh v\'e0 \u273 \'f4i tai r\u7845 t th\'ednh \u7841 !\
\
C\'f4 C\'fa g\uc0\u7853 t \u273 \u7847 u:\
\
\'97 M\uc0\u7895 i lo\'e0i \u273 \u7873 u c\'f3 nh\u7919 ng kh\u7843  n\u259 ng ri\'eang. \u272 i\u7873 u quan tr\u7885 ng l\'e0 bi\u7871 t s\u7917  d\u7909 ng ch\'fang th\u7853 t t\u7889 t.\
\
Khi tan h\uc0\u7885 c, m\'ecnh ch\u7841 y th\u7853 t nhanh v\u7873  nh\'e0.\
\
\'97 Ng\'e0y \uc0\u273 \u7847 u ti\'ean th\u7871  n\'e0o r\u7891 i? \'97 m\u7865  h\u7887 i.\
\
M\'ecnh m\uc0\u7881 m c\u432 \u7901 i th\u7853 t t\u432 \u417 i:\
\
\'97 Tuy\uc0\u7879 t l\u7855 m m\u7865  \u7841 !\
\
H\'f4m nay m\'ecnh h\uc0\u7885 c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c r\u7857 ng ai c\u361 ng c\'f3 \u273 i\u7875 m m\u7841 nh ri\'eang.\
\
V\'e0 m\'ecnh \uc0\u273 \'e3 c\'f3 th\'eam r\u7845 t nhi\u7873 u ng\u432 \u7901 i b\u7841 n m\u7899 i.\
\
H\uc0\u7865 n g\u7863 p l\u7841 i nh\'e9, nh\u7853 t k\'fd!\
